.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH vmexec-inspect 1  "inspect " 
.SH "نام (NAME)"
vmexec\-inspect \- Display detailed information on a virtual machine
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
\fBvmexec inspect\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIVMID\fR> 
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
Display detailed information on a virtual machine
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fIVMID\fR>
Identifier of a virtual machine
